# The version pin has to exist because other modules ask for abseil versions
# that are not in BCR-compatible ranges (tcmalloc wants 20250814.0), and
# forcing one version is what makes the graph resolve. The patches below are
# root-only by design -- an override is ignored for anyone but the root
# module: 0001/0002 are weak-symbol hooks with
# safe defaults, so a dependent that resolves plain BCR abseil still links and
# runs -- it just keeps realtime priority while a fatal message formats.
